Scope
This license applies to the following material in this repository,
together called the "Software":

(a) original Bumpinto World source code, including files under src/,
    server/, scripts/, and addons/, and index.html;

(b) original assets created by or for 김도훈 (CrazyLabs) (the
    "Original Assets"), including:
    - audio under public/audio/ (including recorded bus sound effects
      under public/audio/bus/ and synthesized bike sounds);
    - images and graphics, including public/promo/, public/favicon.svg,
      public/crazylabs-qr.svg, public/donation-qr.svg, and the
      screenshots (shot-*.png, addons/*/shots/);
    - procedural designs of landmarks, buildings, vehicles, characters
      and props as expressed in code, such as
      src/corridor/landmarks/lotteWorldTower.js and src/world/*.js;
    - original text and content, such as NPC dialogue, labels, UI text,
      colour palettes, styling, and hand-authored parameters;

(c) original data authored by CrazyLabs that is not derived from
    OpenStreetMap or another third-party database, to the extent it is
    kept as an independent work (see "Map data" below).

Third-party material
Other licenses stay in force for material that is not this Software:
- third-party components keep their own licenses, including three.js
  (MIT);
- names, places, and brands of third parties that appear in the world
  (for example buildings, shops, transit operators, or vehicles) belong
  to their owners. They are used only to describe real-world places.
  This license grants no rights in them.
This license does not narrow those terms, and nothing in it restricts
any right You have in Third-Party Material under that material's own
license.

Map data (OpenStreetMap / ODbL)
Map data derived from OpenStreetMap is © OpenStreetMap contributors
and is licensed under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0
(https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright). This includes, at least,
public/*.json (jeongja.json, transit.json, drive.json, terrain.json,
starbase.json), public/corridor/**, and the OSM extracts under data/.

- Each of these databases, and any Derivative Database made from them,
  is offered under the ODbL. Where CrazyLabs data is merged into one of
  these databases (for example height corrections, labels, or
  classifications stored in the same file), that database as a whole
  is under the ODbL. This license does not change or add conditions to
  the ODbL for that data.
- Material that is not part of such a database stays under this
  license: the Software that reads, processes, styles, or renders the
  data; procedural models and textures; and CrazyLabs data kept in
  separate, independent files or in code. Combining such material with
  ODbL data in the same world is treated as a Collective Database or
  Produced Work under the ODbL, and only the ODbL data needs to be
  offered under the ODbL.
- The rendered world is a Produced Work. Any public use must keep the
  OpenStreetMap attribution visible, as the current attribution bar
  does.

public/corridor/** also contains building footprints from the Overture
Maps Foundation buildings theme (ODbL; it includes OpenStreetMap and
other sources listed at https://docs.overturemaps.org/attribution/) and
building heights from VWorld GIS building data (브이월드
GIS건물통합정보, 국토교통부). Some features also use transit
information from GBIS (경기도 버스정보, gbis.go.kr) and data.go.kr
(공공데이터포털). Third-party data remains subject to its provider's
terms (VWorld/국토교통부, GBIS/경기도, data.go.kr); this license grants
no rights in it, and You must comply with those terms.

